    {
      "title": "Embodying the output: PaLM-E in a robot control loop. PaLM-E is a generative model producing text based on multi-model sentences as input. In order to connect the output of the model to an embodiment, we distinguish two cases. If the task can be accomplished by outputting text only as, e.g., in embodied question answering or scene description tasks, then the output of the model is directly considered to be the solution for the task.",
